  "info JOTL3113 /properties/lines/additionalItems: additionalItems 改写为 items",
  "info JOTL3103 /properties/note/exclusiveMaximum: exclusiveMaximum: false 无作用, 已移除",
  "info JOTL3101 /definitions/line/id: id 改写为 $id",
  "info JOTL3109 /definitions/line/id: 只含片段的 $id "#line" 改写为 $anchor "line"",
  "info JOTL3120 /properties/lines/items/0/$ref: $ref 随关键字改名调整: "#/definitions/line" → "#/$defs/line"",
